{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge countless shots, unleash your spaceship's destructive power, and annihilate wave after wave of hostile aliens in this explosive vertical-scrolling shoot 'em up. Truxton Extreme is a modern evolution of a classic genre and the return of one of gaming's most iconic franchises. Take on the roles of Ash, Bergamot and Chria as they defend earth from the Geranium invasion through 18 chapters of arcade action and beautiful comic-book storytelling from artist Junya Inoue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S ON LIKE TRUXTON!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton Extreme delivers white-hot shooter thrills for masters and novices alike. Take down hordes of alien invaders with your Power Shot, Truxton Beam, Thunder Laser, and Homing Shot, and remember to breathe as you face off against gigantic bosses in the ultimate battle for humanity\u2019s survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RETRO FURY, MODERN FIREPOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s content, sound, and visuals have all evolved since the 80s. Truxton Extreme is now fully rendered in 3D while preserving the series\u2019 iconic design. Staring insect-like faces, writhing metal tentacles, long mechanical serpents, glowing eye-like lights, and spikes\u2026 In Truxton Extreme, you\u2019ll face your worst nightmares\u2014and blow them to pieces!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOUNDTRACK TO SAVE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton has always been famous for its soundtrack, and Truxton Extreme is no exception. Original mastermind Masahiro Yuge returns with an explosive new score, packed with excitement and atmosphere. Experience iconic Truxton tracks reimagined from the original games alongside brand-new music. It\u2019s the best of both worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PIANO PROGRAMMER WITH LASER DREAMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton was conceived by Masahiro Yuge during his time at Toaplan, with the goal of creating a scrolling shooter where muscle memory was key. But Yuge wasn\u2019t just a programmer, he was a classically trained pianist, bringing a unique and critically acclaimed approach to game design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3323490?t=1770815190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/25e8c635d567d90e247f634529831fa5d7fd57df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770815190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/337cd239a0e12303f54da4baa6e5a5d2d0abede3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770815190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/337cd239a0e12303f54da4baa6e5a5d2d0abede3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770815190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge countless shots, unleash your spaceship's destructive power, and annihilate wave after wave of hostile aliens in this explosive vertical-scrolling shoot 'em up. Truxton Extreme is a modern evolution of a classic genre and the return of one of gaming's most iconic franchises. Take on the roles of Ash, Bergamot and Chria as they defend earth from the Geranium invasion through 18 chapters of arcade action and beautiful comic-book storytelling from artist Junya Inoue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/506c42f9aaeedb9ea54ec6d14904b80d.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S ON LIKE TRUXTON!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton Extreme delivers white-hot shooter thrills for masters and novices alike. Take down hordes of alien invaders with your Power Shot, Truxton Beam, Thunder Laser, and Homing Shot, and remember to breathe as you face off against gigantic bosses in the ultimate battle for humanity\u2019s survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/901f1879c2a5bcdce5df8e30659dc5e8.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RETRO FURY, MODERN FIREPOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s content, sound, and visuals have all evolved since the 80s. Truxton Extreme is now fully rendered in 3D while preserving the series\u2019 iconic design. Staring insect-like faces, writhing metal tentacles, long mechanical serpents, glowing eye-like lights, and spikes\u2026 In Truxton Extreme, you\u2019ll face your worst nightmares\u2014and blow them to pieces!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/8abb8842c64aaa42673ec8da52ad9098.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOUNDTRACK TO SAVE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton has always been famous for its soundtrack, and Truxton Extreme is no exception. Original mastermind Masahiro Yuge returns with an explosive new score, packed with excitement and atmosphere. Experience iconic Truxton tracks reimagined from the original games alongside brand-new music. It\u2019s the best of both worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.poster.avif?t=1770815190\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.webm?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/extras/9846c53002b983a218500946969c11d7.mp4?t=1770815190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PIANO PROGRAMMER WITH LASER DREAMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truxton was conceived by Masahiro Yuge during his time at Toaplan, with the goal of creating a scrolling shooter where muscle memory was key. But Yuge wasn\u2019t just a programmer, he was a classically trained pianist, bringing a unique and critically acclaimed approach to game design.</p>","developers":["Tatsujin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323490/17dcd4a0e8d2bc462faa734fce1aa27ab184f8a5/header.jpg?t=1770815190","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 TATSUJIN Co., Ltd. \u00a9 Published by Clear River Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3323490/869787/3f1dd95b1c076f0f0cd4d9ec5416b0a9cec5fbe2/1750870129/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749364137","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3323490/869787/3f1dd95b1c076f0f0cd4d9ec5416b0a9cec5fbe2/1750870129/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749364137","highlight":true,"hls_h264":