on":"Dodge countless shots, unleash your spaceship's destructive power, and annihilate wave after wave of hostile aliens in this explosive vertical-scrolling shoot 'em up. Truxton Extreme is a modern evolution of a classic genre and the return of one of gaming's most iconic franchises.","steam_appid":3323490,"support_info":{"email":"support@clearrivergames.com","url":"https://www.clearrivergames.com/contact.html"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://truxtonextreme.com"}